{"h":"<h2><strong>Flux2_klein-i2i_T2i_工作流程</strong></h2><p><strong>（图像编辑和文本到图像）</strong></p><h3><strong>一个</strong><strong>非常简单的工作流程</strong><strong>使用</strong></h3><h3><a href=\"https://github.com/princepainter/Comfyui-PainterFluxImageEdit?tab=readme-ov-file#comfyui-painterfluximageedit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"><strong><u>ComfyUI-PainterFluxImageEdit 节点。</u></strong></a></h3><p><strong>编辑最多</strong><strong>3 张图片</strong><strong>并在之间切换</strong><strong>文本到图像。</strong></p><p><strong>注意：如果您想使用图像指定图像尺寸，请使用图像 2 和 3 指定“T2i Latant”的尺寸。</strong></p><p>绕过所有图像会导致 T2i 和棕色 Latant 启用。</p><p>使用图像编辑时，请务必从 image1 启用它</p><p><img src=\"assets/files/civitai/img/256daa30ecfa349e.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>洛拉·洛德</p><p><a href=\"https://civitai.com/search/models?baseModel=Flux.2%20Klein%209B&amp;baseModel=Flux.2%20Klein%209B-base&amp;baseModel=Flux.2%20Klein%204B-base&amp;baseModel=Flux.2%20Klein%204B&amp;modelType=LORA&amp;sortBy=models_v9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">奇维泰 |分享您的模型</a></p><p><img src=\"assets/files/civitai/img/39c9561883c3a7f0.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><h3><strong>要求</strong></h3><p>ComfyUI版本。 0.9.2 或更高</p><h2><strong>Flux2_克莱因</strong></h2><p><strong>型号</strong></p><p><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-klein-4b-fp8/resolve/main/flux-2-klein-4b-fp8.safetensors?download=true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">Flux-2-klein-4b-fp8.safetensors</a></p><p>或其他 FLUX.2-klein 模型（不包括 FLUX.2 [dev]）</p><p><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/collections/black-forest-labs/flux2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">FLUX.2 - black-forest-labs 集合</a></p><p><strong>文本编码器</strong></p><p><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/flux2-klein/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_3_4b.safetensors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/flux2-klein/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_3_4b.safetensors</a></p><p><strong>VAE</strong></p><p><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/flux2-dev/resolve/main/split_files/vae/flux2-vae.safetensors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/flux2-dev/resolve/main/split_files/vae/flux2-vae.safetensors</a></p><p><strong>使用自定义节点</strong><br><a href=\"https://github.com/princepainter/Comfyui-PainterFluxImageEdit?tab=readme-ov-file#comfyui-painterfluximageedit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://github.com/princepainter/Comfyui-PainterFluxImageEdit?tab=readme-ov-file#comfyui-painterfluximageedit</a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/rgthree/rgthree-comfy#----rgthree-comfy--------making-comfyui-more-comfortable----\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://github.com/rgthree/rgthree-comfy#----rgthree-comfy--------making-comfyui-more-comfortable----</a></p>","lang":"en","v":2,"o":"[object Object]"}